==Battleground==
*12 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is similar in difficulty to an EoC 2 Infection Stage. Bring the units you would for one of those stages for this stage. The Ghost BaaBaas pose little threat.

